sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant API as API
    participant AS as AskService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant LLM as LLM
    participant CO as Cohere
    participant W as Worker
    B->>API: POST …/messages/stream/
    API->>DB: save question
    API-->>B: event: question
    API->>AS: ask(question)
    AS->>LLM: expand query
    AS-->>B: status: understanding
    AS->>DB: search + boost
    AS->>CO: rerank
    alt evidence too weak
        AS-->>B: status: finding papers
        AS->>AS: discover (3 sources)
        AS->>W: queue ingestion
        W->>DB: store chunks
        AS->>DB: search again
    end
    AS-->>B: status: writing
    loop streamed output
        AS->>LLM: grounded answer
        AS-->>B: event: delta
    end
    AS->>DB: save answer + citations
    AS-->>B: event: message
